  "details": "Drone cameras have been implemented in Beta, but when playing a large scale battle in a game world, the range of the moving camera can get in the way of filming.\nFor example, Tonbobattlefield has a huge map and it is difficult to check all ranges with the current maximum movement range drone camera.\nIf players who are not participating in the game could have their movement range limitations removed and be able to stream things like Youtube or take pictures of players in the game, it would expand what can be done.",
